#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/architecture.md:1
#: 8da964bd2edb4803a2890dc6cbd08ee5
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Arquitectura"

#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/architecture.md:3
#: b07c48e1733d4965bb1ab47eb57596cd
msgid ""
"A React canvas and backend service coordinate graph editing, subpipeline "
"reuse, explanation, and validation."
msgstr ""
"Un lienzo React y un servicio backend coordinan la edicion de grafos, la "
"reutilizacion de subcanalizaciones, la explicacion y la validacion."

#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/architecture.md:5
#: 62196c624fc64fec8d3195958ccdbe59
msgid "Data flow"
msgstr "Flujo de datos"

#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/architecture.md:11
#: 1cc1c5ba73d64456bd157267bddc052f
msgid "Provenance"
msgstr "Procedencia"

#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/architecture.md:13
#: 773e423a6cd141c59f7400f01961fb46
msgid ""
"Record the repository commit, configuration, input identifiers, execution "
"command, output location, and validation result. A screenshot alone is not a"
" reproducible artifact."
msgstr ""
"Registre el commit del repositorio, la configuracion, los identificadores de"
" entrada, el comando de ejecucion, la ubicacion de salida y el resultado de "
"validacion. Una captura por si sola no es un artefacto reproducible."

#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/architecture.md:15
#: 314356d285864332920556a5eee768a3
msgid "Failure behavior"
msgstr "Comportamiento ante fallos"

#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/architecture.md:17
#: fe03a9ca411840d5916499a8d74b7259
msgid ""
"Missing configuration, unavailable dependencies, invalid input, and failed "
"tests must remain visible. The tool must not replace a failure with invented"
" success."
msgstr ""
"La configuracion ausente, las dependencias no disponibles, una entrada "
"invalida y las pruebas fallidas deben seguir visibles. La herramienta no "
"debe reemplazar un fallo por un exito inventado."
